# Concept note section 6, the PRO encounter target graph.
#
# Copied literally EXCEPT for one reviewer-ordered divergence: the note writes
# ex:ClinicianRole / ex:clinician-role-enc-9 / ex:clinician-c7, and DR-010 renames
# the role to ex:PractitionerRole on OntoClean grounds. Everything else is verbatim.
#
# The person and the practitioner are NOT asserted participants here. They become
# participants only through the SULO property chain
#   hasParticipant o inverseOf(hasFeature) -> hasParticipant
# which is why the participants competency query is marked expects_reasoning
# and why the reasoner choice had to be verified rather than assumed.
#
# Test vector, not a fixture. See egfr-target.ttl.

@prefix sulo: <https://w3id.org/sulo/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://w3id.org/ontostart/fhir2sulo/> .

ex:encounter-9 a sulo:Process, ex:ClinicalEncounter ;
    sulo:hasParticipant ex:patient-role-enc-9, ex:practitioner-role-enc-9 ;
    sulo:atTime ex:interval-enc-9 ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://fhir.example/Encounter/enc-9/_history/1> .

ex:patient-role-enc-9 a sulo:Role, ex:PatientRole ;
    sulo:isFeatureOf ex:person-p123 .

ex:practitioner-role-enc-9 a sulo:Role, ex:PractitionerRole ;
    sulo:isFeatureOf ex:practitioner-c7 .

ex:interval-enc-9 a sulo:TimeInterval ;
    sulo:hasPart ex:start-enc-9, ex:end-enc-9 .

ex:start-enc-9 a sulo:StartTime ;
    sulo:hasValue "2026-09-02T14:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTimeStamp .

ex:end-enc-9 a sulo:EndTime ;
    sulo:hasValue "2026-09-02T14:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTimeStamp .

# Review item R6 is ANSWERED: "a person is a Spatial Object."
#
# This was a placeholder until 2026-09-30 and it disagreed with the maps,
# which emitted bare sulo:Object. That disagreement was itself the finding:
# SULO has Feature disjointWith SpatialObject but also Feature subClassOf
# Object, so SpatialObject makes a person-typed-as-a-Role inconsistent while
# bare Object does not. The measurement is in DR-605 s3 and CD-6; the
# reviewer's answer restores the OWL guard. The placeholder is now the
# answer, and tests/integration/test_reasoning_pro.py checks the maps agree.
ex:person-p123 a sulo:SpatialObject, ex:Person .
ex:practitioner-c7 a sulo:SpatialObject, ex:Person .
